    charTable = "!#$%&'()*+,-./:;=?@[]^_`|~¡¢£¤¥¦§¨©«¬®¯°±´¶·¸»¿×÷˂˃˄˅˒˓˔˕˖˗˘˙˚˛˜˝˞˟˥˦˧˨˩˪˫˭˯˰˱˲˳˴˵˶˷˸˹˺˻˼˽˾˿͵΄϶҂՚՛՜՝՞՟։֊֍֎֏־׀׃׆׳״؆؇؈؉؊؋،؍؎؏؛؝؞؟٪" +
